{"id":3342,"date":"2026-06-22T09:16:51","date_gmt":"2026-06-22T09:16:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3342"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:18:47","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:18:47","slug":"golden-blossom-luxury-stone-mural","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/golden-blossom-luxury-stone-mural\/","title":{"rendered":"Golden Blossom Luxury Stone Mural"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"1101\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"688\">Golden Blossom Luxury Stone Mural Panel<\/strong>, an exclusive decorative wall art solution crafted for spaces that demand premium aesthetics, artistic elegance, and refined architectural detailing. Inspired by delicate cascading floral compositions found in luxury interior design, this handcrafted stone mural beautifully combines intricate botanical carving patterns with elegant golden floral accents that create a rich and visually striking statement wall.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1534\">Designed with a premium ivory stone base complemented by carefully detailed metallic gold floral elements, this mural delivers a perfect balance between modern luxury styling and timeless decorative craftsmanship. The flowing floral arrangement creates a beautiful vertical composition that adds softness, elegance, and depth to contemporary architectural spaces while transforming plain walls into sophisticated art installations.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"2004\">Crafted using premium quality stone materials and advanced carving techniques, this decorative mural offers exceptional durability, long-lasting surface quality, and minimal maintenance requirements for everyday interior applications. Ideal for premium villas, luxury apartments, designer staircases, hotel interiors, reception walls, boutique commercial spaces, and bespoke interior design projects where artistic detailin